{%- comment -%}
  gs-foundation (INLINED) — Growth Sales design backbone for the REAL Kiwify members-area
  theme (ADR-KFY-02, revised). Pure-CSS style tag block, no visible markup, no schema tag.

  WHY INLINED (not a snippet/section): the Kiwify Code Editor used by this account does not
  expose an "add file" action — only the theme's fixed 6 sections + 4 snippets are editable.
  A new snippets/gs-foundation.liquid file (or a foundation section) is therefore unusable.
  This identical style-tag block is duplicated at the top of all 6 real sections
  (banner / login / modules / courses / lessons / continue_watching). CSS is idempotent, so
  duplication across sections is safe — just verbose. If the platform ever allows custom
  files, this can be collapsed back into a single rendered snippet.

  Does what Tailwind classes can't reach: @import fonts, body/void background, textures,
  ::selection, and a best-effort override of the platform's --primary-*/gray CSS vars.
  Per-element accent is guaranteed separately by class edits (KFY-3.5/3.6).

  Logo is NOT handled here — it comes from the real components (club.logo / render 'image').
  Token values: docs/smart-memory/project/growth-sales-design-system.md §1.

  ── TODO(verify) no runtime da Kiwify ──────────────────────────────────────────
  1. Cor-principal do painel: se existir, setar #ff3a0e cascateia ember de graça.
  2. Nomes/formato EXATOS das vars --primary-* / --gray-* (bloco marcado abaixo) —
     não confirmados na doc; override best-effort, ajustar no editor.
  3. Kiwify não sanitiza o @import externo. Se bloquear, as stacks de sistema já
     preservam a hierarquia serif/sans/mono (degradação graciosa).
{%- endcomment -%}
<style>
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..144,300..700;1,9..144,300..600&family=Inter+Tight:wght@300..700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400..600&display=swap');

  :root {
    /* Surfaces */
    --void: #050507;
    --ink: #0e0e11;
    --ink-2: #16161a;
    --ink-3: #1f1f24;
    --hairline: rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
    --hairline-strong: rgba(255,255,255,0.16);
    /* Text (bone) */
    --bone: #f1f1f3;
    --bone-dim: #c5c5ca;
    --bone-mute: #84848c;
    /* Accent (ember) */
    --ember: #ff3a0e;
    --ember-glow: #ff5a1f;
    --ember-hot: #ff7a3d;
    --signal: #e8e8ee;
    /* Type stacks — custom face first, system fallback keeps serif/sans/mono */
    --type-display: 'Fraunces', 'Instrument Serif', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
    --type-sans: 'Inter Tight', 'Geist', system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
    --type-mono: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
    /* Easings */
    --ease-cinema: cubic-bezier(0.7, 0, 0.2, 1);
    --ease-glide: cubic-bezier(0.25, 1, 0.3, 1);
    --ease-snap: cubic-bezier(0.5, 0, 0, 1);
    /* Display scale */
    --fs-hero: clamp(56px, 7.5vw, 112px);
    --fs-h2: clamp(44px, 5.5vw, 72px);
  }

  /* ── Best-effort override of the platform's Tailwind color variables ─────
     TODO(verify): confirmar nomes e FORMATO reais das vars --primary-* no runtime.
     A plataforma usa classes numéricas (bg-primary-500/800) e semânticas (bg-primary,
     text-primary-foreground). Cobrimos as duas convenções mais comuns do
     Tailwind-com-CSS-vars; valores em formato errado são ignorados (inócuos). O acento
     por-componente é garantido por classe em KFY-3.5/3.6. */
  :root, .dark, [data-theme="dark"], [data-theme="light"] {
    /* shadcn-style semantic tokens (HSL channels → hsl(var(--primary))) */
    --primary: 11 100% 53%;               /* #ff3a0e ember */
    --primary-foreground: 240 17% 2%;     /* #050507 void */
    --ring: 11 100% 53%;
    /* numeric scale (RGB channels → rgb(var(--primary-500))) */
    --primary-50: 255 237 232;
    --primary-100: 255 214 204;
    --primary-200: 255 173 153;
    --primary-300: 255 122 61;            /* ember-hot */
    --primary-400: 255 90 31;             /* ember-glow */
    --primary-500: 255 58 14;             /* ember */
    --primary-600: 230 50 10;
    --primary-700: 194 42 8;
    --primary-800: 158 34 6;
    --primary-900: 122 26 4;
  }

  /* ── Base (dark-first — void domina em light e dark) ─────────────────────── */
  html { background: var(--void); color-scheme: dark; }
  body {
    background: var(--void);
    color: var(--bone-dim);
    font-family: var(--type-sans);
    font-weight: 300;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    font-feature-settings: "ss01", "cv11";
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    position: relative;
    min-height: 100vh;
  }

  ::selection { background: var(--ember); color: var(--void); }

  /* ── Background textures (fixed, non-interactive, behind content) ───────── */
  body::before {
    content: "";
    position: fixed; inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none; z-index: 1;
    background-image:
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 30%, transparent 30%, rgba(0,0,0,0.45) 100%),
      radial-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 1px, transparent 1px),
      repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.012) 0 1px, transparent 1px 3px);
    background-size: 100% 100%, 24px 24px, 100% 3px;
  }
  body::after {
    content: "";
    position: fixed; inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none; z-index: 1;
    opacity: 0.8; mix-blend-mode: overlay;
    background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.08) 0.5px, transparent 0.5px);
    background-size: 3px 3px;
  }
  /* Keep the real content above the textures */
  body > * { position: relative; z-index: 2; }
</style>
{% assign slides_count = section.block_order.size %}
{% assign slides_delay = section.settings.slides_delay | default: 3 %}
{% assign slides_order = section.block_order %}
{% assign slides = section.blocks %}

{% if slides_count > 0 or is_preview %}
  {% comment %}
    embla class enables the carousel
    data-slides-delay enables autoplay and controls the delay between slides
    data-embla-options is the options for the carousel in JSON format; all options are listed in the embla documentation: https://www.embla-carousel.com/api/options/
  {% endcomment %}
  <div
    class="embla relative overflow-hidden group"
    data-slides-delay="{{ slides_delay }}"
    data-embla-options='{ "loop": true, "dragFree": false{% if slides_count == 1 %}, "active": false{% endif %} }'
  >
    {% comment %} embla__viewport is the area that contains the slides {% endcomment %}
    <div class="embla__viewport overflow-hidden">
      <div class="embla__container flex">
        {%- for slide_id in slides_order -%}
          {%- assign slide = slides[slide_id].settings -%}
          <div class="embla__slide flex-shrink-0 w-screen max-w-full">
            {%- if slide.banner_type == 'image' -%}
              <picture>
                {% if slide.desktop_image %}
                  <source
                    media="(min-width: 768px)"
                    srcset="{{ slide.desktop_image }}"
                  >
                {% endif %}
                {% if slide.mobile_image %}
                  <source srcset="{{ slide.mobile_image }}">
                {% endif %}
                <img
                  src="{{ slide.desktop_image | default: slide.mobile_image }}"
                  alt=""
                  loading="lazy"
                  width="2000"
                  height="590"
                  class="
                    select-none pointer-events-none w-full
                    aspect-[768/432] sm:aspect-[2000/590] object-cover
                  "
                >
              </picture>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>
    </div>

    {% comment %}
      Arrows are used to navigate between slides.
      data-embla-prev is the button that navigates to the previous slide
      data-embla-next is the button that navigates to the next slide
    {% endcomment %}
    {% if slides_count > 1 %}
      <button
        data-embla-prev
        class="embla__button absolute z-10 transform top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 flex items-center justify-center rounded-none outline-none p-0 m-0 w-8 lg:w-12 h-8 lg:h-12 *:w-6 lg:*:w-8 *:h-6 lg:*:h-8 opacity-50 sm:opacity-0 sm:group-hover:opacity-50 sm:group-focus-within:opacity-50 text-[#050507] bg-[#ff3a0e] group-hover:hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-[#ff3a0e] focus-visible:focus:opacity-100 transition-all ease-in-out duration-300 left-0 md:left-2 scale-100"
      >
        <svg
          aria-hidden="true"
          role="img"
          width="1em"
          height="1em"
          viewBox="0 0 16 16"
        >
          <path fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M9.78 4.22a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06L7.06 8l2.72 2.72a.75.75 0 1 1-1.06 1.06L5.47 8.53a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.06l3.25-3.25a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0" clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
        </svg>
      </button>

      <button
        data-embla-next
        class="embla__button absolute z-10 transform top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 flex items-center justify-center rounded-none outline-none p-0 m-0 w-8 lg:w-12 h-8 lg:h-12 *:w-6 lg:*:w-8 *:h-6 lg:*:h-8 opacity-50 sm:opacity-0 sm:group-hover:opacity-50 sm:group-focus-within:opacity-50 text-[#050507] bg-[#ff3a0e] group-hover:hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-[#ff3a0e] focus-visible:focus:opacity-100 transition-all ease-in-out duration-300 right-0 md:right-2 scale-100"
      >
        <svg
          aria-hidden="true"
          role="img"
          width="1em"
          height="1em"
          viewBox="0 0 16 16"
        >
          <path fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M6.22 4.22a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0l3.25 3.25a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-3.25 3.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06-1.06L8.94 8L6.22 5.28a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.06" clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
        </svg>
      </button>
    {% endif %}

    {% comment %}
      Dots are used to navigate between slides.
      data-embla-dot is the button that navigates to the corresponding slide, i.e, the first dot navigates to the first slide, the second dot navigates to the second slide, etc.
    {% endcomment %}
    {% if slides_count > 1 %}
      <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-0 right-0 flex gap-1 justify-center">
        {%- for slide_id in slides_order -%}
          <button
            class="flex-shrink-0 w-4 h-4 flex items-center justify-center"
            data-embla-dot
          >
            <div
              class="dot w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#ff3a0e] opacity-30 hover:opacity-50 transition-all duration-200"
            ></div>
          </button>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
{% endif %}

{% comment %}
  O CONTEÚDO ABAIXO É PARA O EDITOR DE TEMA. SAIBA MAIS EM: https://docs.kiwify.com.br/members-area/reference/schema/overview
  SCHEMA IS FOR THE THEME EDITOR. KNOW MORE IN: https://docs.kiwify.com.br/en/members-area/reference/schema/overview
{% endcomment %}
{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:sections.banner.title",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "slides_delay",
      "label": "t:sections.banner.slides_delay",
      "min": 3,
      "max": 60,
      "step": 1,
      "default": 3,
      "unit": "s"
    }
  ],
  "kiwi_extra": {
    "icon": "fas fa-images"
  },
  "max_blocks": 3,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "slide",
      "name": "t:sections.banner.slide",
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "select",
          "id": "banner_type",
          "label": "t:sections.banner.banner_type",
          "default": "image",
          "options": [
            {
              "value": "image",
              "label": "t:sections.banner.image",
              "kiwi_extra": {
                "icon": "fas fa-image"
              }
            }
          ],
          "kiwi_extra": {
            "icon": "fas fa-cog",
            "hidden": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "image_picker",
          "id": "mobile_image",
          "label": "t:sections.banner.mobile_image",
          "default": "https://placehold.co/768x432"
        },
        {
          "type": "image_picker",
          "id": "desktop_image",
          "label": "t:sections.banner.desktop_image",
          "default": "https://placehold.co/2000x590"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "t:sections.banner.title",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "slide"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
